        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/2026-10-19-neuromesodermal-jamming-audit-tailbud-neuromesodermal-jamming-3> ;
    pk:hypothesisType "Active Fluid-to-Solid Jamming Transition & Bingham Viscoplastic Axis Elongation (Mongera-Kim-Campas Active Foam Mechanics)" ;
    pk:weightOfEvidence 5.41e-01 .

