<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-tailbud-neuromesodermal-jamming-code-traceability> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Mongera et al. (2018) & Kim et al. (2021) zebrafish tailbud active fluid-to-solid jamming transition & yield-stress axis elongation — Code-to-model traceability: 69/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Functions map to the Mongera et al. (2018) yield stress relation, and `morphoeval/lean/loops/Loop_030_neuromesodermal_jamming.lean` proves 4 machine-checked theorems, but v1 docstrings lack equation-by-equation mappings to Kim et al. (2021) active foam T1 kinetics, Bingham viscoplastic backstop rectification, and `cdh2` bilateral asymmetry." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-code-traceability> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/code-traceability" ;
    pk:evidenceAgainst "2022-tailbud-neuromesodermal-jamming.py L33–L80: Baseline functions lack equation mappings to active foam T1 rates, Bingham flow, and cdh2 knockdown asymmetry <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/0cb0132/2022-tailbud-neuromesodermal-jamming.py#L33-L80>" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-tailbud-neuromesodermal-jamming-code-traceability-1> ;
    pk:hasScore 6.9e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "mostly faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-tailbud-neuromesodermal-jamming-model-fidelity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Mongera et al. (2018) & Kim et al. (2021) zebrafish tailbud active fluid-to-solid jamming transition & yield-stress axis elongation — Model fidelity to source: 66/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Evaluates the Mongera et al. (2018) rigidity-percolation yield stress scaling `sigma_y(phi_ECS)` (`compute_yield_stress_v1`, L33-49) and a 1D posterior-to-anterior `phi_ECS(x)` gradient (`simulate_tailbud_jamming_v1`, L52-80). However, v1 omits active Myosin-II cell-scale tension fluctuations `sigma_A(x)`, omits Kramers/Eyring T1 cage-breaking rates `k_T1(x)` (Kim et al. 2021), and omits 2D Bingham viscoplastic tailbud flow and `cdh2` morphant bilateral asymmetry mechanics." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-model-fidelity> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/model-fidelity" ;
    pk:evidenceAgainst "2022-tailbud-neuromesodermal-jamming.py L52–L80: 1D baseline lacks active tension fluctuations sigma_A(x), T1 rearrangement rate k_T1(x), and 2D Bingham viscoplastic axis elongation <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/0cb0132/2022-tailbud-neuromesodermal-jamming.py#L52-L80>" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-tailbud-neuromesodermal-jamming-model-fidelity-1> ;
    pk:hasScore 6.6e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "mostly faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-tailbud-neuromesodermal-jamming-morphometric-validation> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Mongera et al. (2018) & Kim et al. (2021) zebrafish tailbud active fluid-to-solid jamming transition & yield-stress axis elongation — Morphometric validation: 53/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Computes 3 basic summary values (`mpz_yield_stress_Pa`, `apsm_yield_stress_Pa`, `critical_packing_phi_c`, L155-177), but does not validate simulated `phi_ECS(x)`, `sigma_y(x)`, `sigma_A(x)`, `k_T1(x)`, elongation velocity `v_elong`, or bilateral asymmetry against Mongera et al. (2018) reference tables, nor does it extract nuclear packing or interstitial void fractions from the zebrafish tailbud specimen." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-morphometric-validation> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/morphometric-validation" ;
    pk:evidenceAgainst "2022-tailbud-neuromesodermal-jamming.py L155–L177: Only 3 basic metrics without Mongera et al. (2018) AP profile correlation, perturbation validation, or specimen segmentation <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/0cb0132/2022-tailbud-neuromesodermal-jamming.py#L155-L177>" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-tailbud-neuromesodermal-jamming-measurement-apsm-yield-stress-pa>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-tailbud-neuromesodermal-jamming-measurement-critical-packing-phi-c>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-tailbud-neuromesodermal-jamming-measurement-mpz-yield-stress-pa> ;
    pk:hasScore 5.3e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "partially faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-tailbud-neuromesodermal-jamming-overall> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Mongera et al. (2018) & Kim et al. (2021) zebrafish tailbud active fluid-to-solid jamming transition & yield-stress axis elongation — MorphoEval overall 54.1/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Pass 1 (v1) evaluation of `2022-tailbud-neuromesodermal-jamming.py` (57.3/100). The v1 baseline implements the Mongera et al. (2018) rigidity-percolation yield stress law `sigma_y(x) = sigma_0 * max(0, phi_pack(x) - phi_c)^beta` along a 1D exponential extracellular space profile `phi_ECS(x)`, but omits active cell-scale tension fluctuations `sigma_A(x)` and Kramers T1 rearrangement kinetics `k_T1(x)`, omits a 2D active-foam / Bingham viscoplastic axis elongation solver across wild-type, `cdh2` (N-cadherin) knockdown, Blebbistatin, SU5402, and zero-backstop ablation regimes, does not load or segment the vendored zebrafish tailbud lightsheet micrograph (`zebrafish_tailbud_psm_specimen.jpg`), and exposes no CLI parameter flags beyond `--self-test`. Overall 54.1/100 (faithfulness 48.8, reproducibility 66.6); rubric morphoeval 0.1.0; checkpoint commit 0cb0132; environment: python 3.14.7, numpy 2.4.2, scipy 1.17.0, matplotlib 3.10.8, Pillow 12.1.1. Dimension assessments: Model fidelity to source 66, Morphological realism / specimen match 34, Parameter expressivity 45, Morphometric validation 53, Source and data traceability 63, Code-to-model traceability 69, Reproducibility package 68. Output judged: docs/media/neuromesodermal_jamming_comparison.png: rendered output of 2022-tailbud-neuromesodermal-jamming.py at 0cb0132, image/png, 82041 B, 1755×546 px, artifact_sha256 f128c0da1d1f0d2d9c9f49460ff29892ff09eabb6e8f1dfcd0eb2453fb4d4d43 (sha256 f128c0da1d1f0d2d9c9f49460ff29892ff09eabb6e8f1dfcd0eb2453fb4d4d43), spec_fingerprint 5225f2c29acda8d1ee81d082219556f85a1159006d552c629f56ce7d8a842027. Dual provenance: spec_fingerprint: 5225f2c29acda8d1ee81d082219556f85a1159006d552c629f56ce7d8a842027; artifact_sha256: f128c0da1d1f0d2d9c9f49460ff29892ff09eabb6e8f1dfcd0eb2453fb4d4d43." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-rubric-0.1.0> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/overall" ;
    pk:evidenceAgainst "remediation needed: Implement full active-foam & Bingham viscoplastic axis elongation mechanics across MPZ, P-PSM, and A-PSM, coupling extracellular space compaction phi_ECS(x), Maxwell coordination z(x), ferrofluid yield stress sigma_y(x), active Myosin-II fluctuations sigma_A(x), and Kramers T1 rearrangement rate k_T1(x).",
        "remediation needed: Load and SHA-256-verify `datasets/neuromesodermal_jamming/neuromesodermal_jamming_reference.json` and `zebrafish_tailbud_psm_specimen.jpg` (IDR0051 lightsheet micrograph), segment nuclear centroids and Voronoi cell polygons across MPZ, P-PSM, and A-PSM to measure empirical interstitial void decay, cell packing compaction, and bilateral symmetry across the notochord.",
        "remediation needed: Simulate all 5 experimental regimes from Mongera et al. (2018) and Lawton et al. (2013): Wild-Type Control, cdh2 (N-cadherin) Knockdown Unjamming & Bilateral Asymmetry, Blebbistatin Myosin-II Inhibition, SU5402 FGFR Inhibition, and Uniform-Fluid Zero-Backstop Ablation Control, plus a 2D active-foam cellular packing & Bingham velocity field solver." ;
    pk:hasScore 5.41e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "partially faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-tailbud-neuromesodermal-jamming-parameter-expressivity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
